1
00:00:00,583 --> 00:00:01,883
(Howard:)This is her
last brisket.

2
00:00:01,885 --> 00:00:03,485
(Howard:)This is her
last meatloaf.

3
00:00:03,487 --> 00:00:04,817
(Howard:)This is her last...

4
00:00:06,655 --> 00:00:09,555
(Howard:)I have no idea
what this is, but...

5
00:00:09,559 --> 00:00:12,399
(Howard:)it's the last one.

6
00:00:12,396 --> 00:00:14,026
(Raj:)Everything okay?

7
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,230
(Sheldon:)No.

8
00:00:15,232 --> 00:00:18,262
(Howard:)All Ma's food is
gonna be ruined.

9
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:20,638
(Bernadette:)Well, why don't we take it home
and put it in our freezer?

10
00:00:20,637 --> 00:00:22,337
(Raj:)You don't want
to do that.

11
00:00:22,339 --> 00:00:24,309
(Raj:)Refreezing not only
removes moisture,

12
00:00:24,307 --> 00:00:26,607
(Raj:)but it creates ice crystals
in the fibers of the meat

13
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:29,310
(Raj:)that can compromise
its taste and texture.

14
00:00:30,746 --> 00:00:32,146
(Raj:)What? I saw a teachable moment.

15
00:00:32,149 --> 00:00:34,479
(Raj:)I dropped some culinary science.

16
00:00:36,685 --> 00:00:38,585
(Bernadette:)What should we do?

17
00:00:38,588 --> 00:00:40,888
(Howard:)I'll tell you exactly
what we're gonna do.

18
00:00:40,891 --> 00:00:42,721
(Howard:)We're gonna eat it.

19
00:00:42,726 --> 00:00:44,596
There's, like, 20 pounds
of food in there.

20
00:00:44,594 --> 00:00:45,694
(Howard:)All you said

21
00:00:45,695 --> 00:00:47,365
(Howard:)was I had to get rid of things.

22
00:00:47,364 --> 00:00:50,264
(Howard:)You didn't say they couldn't
pass through my colon first.

23
00:00:50,267 --> 00:00:53,567
(Bernadette:)Howie...

24
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,200
(Raj:)Okay.

25
00:00:55,205 --> 00:00:57,705
(Howard:)Then how about this?

26
00:00:57,707 --> 00:00:59,907
(Howard:)Let's invite everyone
over to dinner.

